WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:06.113
What's the FIRST STEP to start a business?

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:08.464
So I got a great question from one of my YouTube viewers

00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:09.241
(love you guys!)

00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:11.899
from ThePolybagCollector, who wrote in to say

00:00:12.325 --> 00:00:14.116
“If you want to start a business

00:00:14.324 --> 00:00:16.460
what’s the first step you should take?

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:18.169
So this is a great question.

00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:21.105
The most important first step

00:00:21.301 --> 00:00:23.123
bar none is an easy question.

00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:25.739
For those of you who are loyal subscribers of the channel

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.305
you already know what I’m going to say

00:00:28.822 --> 00:00:30.728
you have to find your passion.

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:33.621
You have to build a business around something

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:35.153
that you are passionate about.

00:00:35.913 --> 00:00:37.412
You have to be a little bit crazy

00:00:37.611 --> 00:00:39.933
to be an entrepreneur because it’s going to be

00:00:40.102 --> 00:00:41.789
really, really, really hard

00:00:42.194 --> 00:00:44.081
and nobody really talks about how hard

00:00:44.223 --> 00:00:45.193
it is to be an entrepreneur.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.873
You just hear all the good things

00:00:47.277 --> 00:00:48.632
and the big wins and the huge successes

00:00:48.941 --> 00:00:50.360
but it’s really hard!

00:00:50.524 --> 00:00:51.448
It’s going to be the hardest thing

00:00:51.448 --> 00:00:52.295
you’ve ever done in your life

00:00:53.316 --> 00:00:55.252
it’s starting a business and making it successful.

00:00:55.451 --> 00:00:56.044
It’s that hard.

00:00:56.368 --> 00:00:58.672
The same people, the logical people

00:00:58.888 --> 00:00:59.661
the normal people

00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:02.365
they’re going to quit because it gets too hard.

00:01:03.642 --> 00:01:06.060
So you have to have a little bit of crazy in you

00:01:06.891 --> 00:01:08.540
to be successful as an entrepreneur

00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:11.459
and it’s that deep love

00:01:11.656 --> 00:01:13.855
and passion for what you’re doing.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.081
The things that you would do even if you weren’t getting any money

00:01:17.302 --> 00:01:18.305
even if you’re not getting paid

00:01:18.632 --> 00:01:20.748
saying, “I need to keep doing this because this is important.”

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.583
One of my favorite examples is George Lucas

00:01:22.846 --> 00:01:24.572
who started Star Wars and Lucas Films

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:25.540
and Indiana Jones

00:01:25.863 --> 00:01:29.226
and his first six years in business were a failure

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.258
complete failure – six years!

00:01:31.921 --> 00:01:33.307
And his friends and his family said

00:01:33.503 --> 00:01:35.245
“George, do the safe thing, get a job.

00:01:35.472 --> 00:01:36.473
What are you doing?

00:01:36.935 --> 00:01:38.429
This is not working.

00:01:38.993 --> 00:01:40.227
Okay, one year, two years…

00:01:40.227 --> 00:01:40.790
Six years?!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.961
It’s not working, man. Stop!

00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:44.077
You’re crazy.”

00:01:44.927 --> 00:01:46.980
And what kept him going,

00:01:47.241 --> 00:01:49.272
it wasn’t that he wanted to try to make a lot of money

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.130
it’s that he loved films.

00:01:51.743 --> 00:01:52.793
And he said, “You know what?

00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:54.712
I don’t care if I ever make money on this.

00:01:55.149 --> 00:01:57.073
I have to find a way to keep going

00:01:57.281 --> 00:01:58.468
because I love it so much.

00:01:59.104 --> 00:02:00.492
That’s what kept him going.

00:02:00.773 --> 00:02:02.821
That’s what you need to find to keep you going.

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.665
Lucas now is worth over 4 billion dollars.

00:02:05.824 --> 00:02:06.972
He’s a multibillionaire.

00:02:07.805 --> 00:02:09.261
But he only got there

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:10.457
it was never about the money for him

00:02:10.684 --> 00:02:13.413
he got there because he loved what he was doing.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.332
So the number 1 most important rule

00:02:15.528 --> 00:02:16.368
how do you get started

00:02:16.562 --> 00:02:17.433
find you passion.

00:02:17.896 --> 00:02:21.048
Do something that you love and keep doing it every day.

00:02:21.257 --> 00:02:23.453
Find something that you can’t live without doing.

00:02:23.645 --> 00:02:26.392
You have to create this thing in the world because

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.960
it’s a part of you and you have to share it

00:02:29.155 --> 00:02:31.587
and help other people achieve whatever their goals are.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:33.154
That’s your first rule.

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:34.450
Believe.

00:02:35.141 --> 00:02:36.852
For those of you watching, you liked the video

00:02:36.852 --> 00:02:37.423
– thumbs-up below.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:38.565
Let me know what you think.

00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:40.623
Leave a comment below, ask me a question.

00:02:40.623 --> 00:02:41.933
I’ll make a video response.

00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:44.489
And click on my face if you want to subscribe to the channel

00:02:44.585 --> 00:02:45.345
and see more videos like this.

00:02:45.584 --> 00:02:47.232
Thank you so much, I’ll see you soon.

